    social.socialCohesion.communityBonds + cohesionChange
  ));

  // === DISASTER COOPERATION BOOST (Evidence-Based Recovery, Oct 17, 2025) ===
  // Research: Wei et al. (2025), Drury et al. (2019), Zaki & Cikara (2020)
