## Option 1: TypeScript `satisfies` + Strict Initialization (Best for Compile-Time)

```typescript
// Force all properties to be initialized at creation
const gameState = {
  society: {
    communityStrength: 0.5,
    // TypeScript will error if you forget a required property
  },
